  "description": "<p>Hi! My name is Toni, the creator of this model. I really hope you like the model and find it useful. If you have any questions or issues, you can reach me via ArtStation, and I will try to help if I can. Thank you.</p><p></p><p><strong>Description</strong>:</p><p></p><p><strong>I higly recommend using the Blender archive.</strong></p><p></p><p>This model was made in Blender 4.5 - Renders made with Cycles.<br>Approximately 53k vertices.</p><p><br>Consists of 6 materials:</p><ul><li><p>Hair - 2k textures (Color, Roughness, Alpha, Normal)</p></li><li><p>Armor - 4k textures (Color, Roughness, Metallic, Normal)</p></li><li><p>Skin - 2k textures (Color, Roughness, Normal)</p></li><li><p>Eye - 512 textures (Color, Roughness, Normal)</p></li><li><p>Eyer Lens - No textures</p></li><li><p>Sword - 1024x4096 (Color, Roughness, Normal)</p><p></p>",
